        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>36\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 36 inch stainless steel door handle features an easy to grip 1-1/8 inch square pull handle that is very comfortable. Made from stainless steel with a satin stainless finish, its a great and modern door handle for almost any application. The 36 Inch Square Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG443-914-speifications.jpg?v=1704354726\" width=\"587\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Square Stainless Steel Door Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/satin-stainless-steel-14-inch-square-door-handle\"><b>14\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/24-inch-square-door-handles-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>24\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/48-inch-square-door-handles-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>48\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/60-inch-square-door-handles-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>60\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Square Stainless Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 36\" (914 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 24-7/16\" (620 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/16\" (81 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/8\" (29 mm) Square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
